MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice:: @ 818C7E3
	.string "Yo, how's it going, CHAMPION-bound\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "The GYM LEADERS here use PSYCHIC-type\n"
	.string "DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "If you go up against them with\n"
	.string "FIGHTING- or POISON-type DIGIMON,\l"
	.string "they'll inflict horrible damage!\p"
	.string "Plus, they'll come at you with\n"
	.string "outstanding combination attacks.\p"
	.string "If you want to win, you'll need to show\n"
	.string "them how tight you are with your\l"
	.string "DIGIMON. Go for it!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory:: @ 818C938
	.string "Wow, you're astounding!\n"
	.string "You're one great TRAINER!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_PrestonIntro:: @ 818C96A
	.string "Battles hinge on the strength of your\n"
	.string "spirit! The weak-spirited will never win!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_PrestonDefeat:: @ 818C9BA
	.string "I lost! I must temper my spirit again!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_PrestonPostBattle:: @ 818C9E1
	.string "The indecisive lose.\n"
	.string "That's my warning to you.$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_VirgilIntro:: @ 818CA10
	.string "Let me see your talent!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_VirgilDefeat:: @ 818CA28
	.string "You possess spectacular talent!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_VirgilPostBattle:: @ 818CA48
	.string "If there are prodigies in the world,\n"
	.string "then our GYM LEADERS are them!\p"
	.string "However, you may be even more talented\n"
	.string "than them...$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_FritzIntro:: @ 818CAC0
	.string "Fufufufu... Watch me levitate a POKé\n"
	.string "BALL telekinetically!\p"
	.string "Wrooooooooaaaar!\n"
	.string "... ... ... ... ... ... ...\p"
	.string "Sometimes, I'm out of sync...$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_FritzDefeat:: @ 818CB46
	.string "My DIGIMON battling skills are out\n"
	.string "of sync, too!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_FritzPostBattle:: @ 818CB77
	.string "A DIGI DISK was too heavy to lift\n"
	.string "psychically. But this dust bunny...\p"
	.string "Whoooooooooooooooh!\n"
	.string "... ... ... ... ... ...\p"
	.string "No, I'm not cheating!\n"
	.string "I didn't blow on it! Honestly!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_HannahIntro:: @ 818CC1E
	.string "When you lose to me, don't be too hard\n"
	.string "on yourself.\p"
	.string "It's not that you're weak - I'm just\n"
	.string "too strong!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_HannahDefeat:: @ 818CC83
	.string "You're just too strong!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_HannahPostBattle:: @ 818CC9B
	.string "I'm not going to get down on myself for\n"
	.string "losing. I just need to train harder.\p"
	.string "Positive thinking - that's my strong\n"
	.string "point!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaIntro:: @ 818CD14
	.string "I see it...\n"
	.string "I see your future...\p"
	.string "If you can beat me, I will tell you\n"
	.string "your future!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaDefeat:: @ 818CD66
	.string "I surrender!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaPostBattle:: @ 818CD73
	.string "You will wage a terrifically intense\n"
	.string "battle with our GYM LEADERS...\p"
	.string "The result...\n"
	.string "You won't hear it from me!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MauraIntro:: @ 818CDE0
	.string "The roads you have traveled...\n"
	.string "What you have experienced...\p"
	.string "Come at me with everything you've\n"
	.string "learned!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MauraDefeat:: @ 818CE47
	.string "You've traveled a path of greatness!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MauraPostBattle:: @ 818CE6C
	.string "A bright future awaits those who have\n"
	.string "worked diligently.\p"
	.string "For those who lazed idly, there is\n"
	.string "only despair at the end.\p"
	.string "What goes around comes around...$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaIntro:: @ 818CF02
	.string "TATE & LIZA: I guard the MIND\n"
	.string "KEY, one of eight locks on the\p"
	.string "way home.\p"
	.string "Your bond must withstand this\n"
	.string "world's rules. Show me how you\p"
	.string "and your partner fight together!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaDefeat:: @ 818D077
	.string "TATE & LIZA: Your bond endured.\n"
	.string "The MIND KEY now belongs to you.$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedMindBadge:: @ 818D0F9
	.string "{PLAYER} received DIGITAL KEY 7:\n"
	.string "MIND!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_ExplainMindBadgeTakeThis:: @ 818D128
	.string "The MIND KEY restores access to\n"
	.string "DIVE outside battle. Its other\p"
	.string "battle permissions remain\n"
	.string "active.\p"
	.string "This technique will help you\n"
	.string "cross the damaged world. Take it\p"
	.string "with you.$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_ExplainCalmMind:: @ 818D1CF
	.string "TATE: That TM04 contains...\n"
	.string "LIZA: CALM MIND!\p"
	.string "TATE: It raises SP. ATK and...\n"
	.string "LIZA: It raises SP. DEF!\p"
	.string "TATE: It's a move that's perfect...\n"
	.string "LIZA: For PSYCHIC DIGIMON!$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaPostBattle:: @ 818D273
	.string "You have the MIND KEY. Keep\n"
	.string "seeking the remaining guardians.\p"
	.string "The gate home needs all eight.\n"
	.string "Your partner is your anchor; do\p"
	.string "not lose hope.$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_TateAndLizaNeedTwoMons:: @ 818D324
	.string "TATE: Hehehe... Were you surprised?\p"
	.string "LIZA: That there are two GYM LEADERS?\p"
	.string "TATE: Oops, you have only one...\n"
	.string "LIZA: DIGIMON that can battle.\p"
	.string "TATE: We can't battle that way!\p"
	.string "LIZA: If you want to challenge us,\n"
	.string "bring some more DIGIMON.$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue:: @ 818D40A
	.string "MOSSDEEP CITY DIGIMON GYM$"

MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified:: @ 818D424
	.string "MOSSDEEP CITY DIGIMON GYM\p"
	.string "LIZA AND TATE'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
